        <item>
            <title>0.59</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 15:37:19 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1781908445</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.59</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Added multi-repository project support. Projects containing multiple Git repos now detect and manage them automatically — the Git pane shows an accordion view with each repository as its own expandable section, complete with independent staging, committing, and branch management.</li>
<li>Added a model catalog that discovers available models from installed CLI binaries (Claude Code, Codex). A new &quot;Available models&quot; section in Settings shows all discovered models with a Refresh button. The model picker now includes catalog-discovered models alongside custom profiles.</li>
<li>Added one-click cloud project download. Projects synced from other devices via iCloud now show a &quot;Download to This Mac&quot; button that clones the repository into the same home-relative path as the originating device.</li>
<li>Added addyruncommand MCP tool for running finite shell commands in their own visible terminal pane. The tool blocks until the command exits and returns the exit code plus output tail — filling the gap between native Bash (invisible) and addystartserver (persistent).</li>
<li>Added MCP tool call approval UI for non-Addy MCP servers. When an agent requests a third-party MCP tool, Addy now shows an Allow / Allow for session / Deny permission card instead of silently declining.</li>
<li>Added an in-app manual with illustrated pages covering the sidebar, panes, agent workflows, plans, and memory. The manual opens automatically during onboarding and is accessible from the sidebar help button.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Onboarding streamlined to three steps (Welcome, Dependencies, Agent CLIs) and now includes a &quot;Say hi&quot; button that lets each newly installed CLI greet the user with a one-shot message.</li>
<li>Project knowledge (memories, context, architecture docs) moved from the in-repo .addy/ directory to an app-owned knowledge store, keeping project repositories clean. Existing .addy/ directories are migrated automatically.</li>
<li>Cross-device project sync now includes sidebar order, chat conversation history, and worktree branch names — so your workspace layout transfers between Macs.</li>
<li>CloudKit sync engine reworked to avoid re-entering main-thread-only stores from background callbacks, and to deduplicate pending record zone changes.</li>
<li>Pane mutation notifications (split/resize) now scope to the affected view hierarchy instead of triggering relayout across every chat and diff view in every project, improving responsiveness during multi-pane edits.</li>
<li>Context window sizes are now resolved from the refreshed model catalog instead of a hardcoded lookup table, so new models are recognized without an app update.</li>
<li>System theme mode now debounces redundant appearance change notifications, preventing unnecessary relayouts when macOS sends duplicate updates.</li>
<li>macOS Dictation no longer causes lag in the chat composer — text-driven resizes are now applied immediately without animation.</li>
<li>Chat scroll view and table view no longer show a focus ring.</li>
<li>Settings window height increased to accommodate the new model catalog section.</li>
<li>Git tools (addygitstatus, addygitbranches, addygitcheckout) now accept repositoryid and repositorypath parameters for targeting specific repos in multi-repo projects.</li>
<li>addynotifypane can now send messages to panes in other open projects.</li>
<li>Pane list IPC encoding switched from dictionary-based JSONSerialization to a typed Codable struct for consistent key ordering.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed a data loss scenario where terminating the app with an empty in-memory sidebar would overwrite a valid persisted project list. Addy now skips the save when the sidebar is empty but the persisted file is not.</li>
<li>Added automatic backup and recovery for project and pane layout data. Both SessionStore and PaneStore now write a .bak file before each save and recover from it if the primary file is missing or corrupt.</li>
<li>Fixed cross-project MCP tool routing where an implicit sourcepaneid from the calling pane could override an explicit project_path, causing operations to target the wrong project.</li>
<li>Fixed MCP permission cards not recognizing the &quot;Allow for session&quot; response variant, which could show &quot;Denied&quot; text instead of &quot;Allowed for session.&quot;</li>
<li>Fixed chat model picker not showing catalog-discovered models by switching from raw modelProfiles to availableModelProfiles().</li>
</ul>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Now I have a complete picture. Here are the release notes</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
